IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. EXAMPLE-2.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-BANK-NAME          PIC X(30) VALUE "COBOL BANKING SYSTEM".
01 WS-EXECUTION-DATE     PIC X(10) VALUE "2026-09-26".
01 WS-VERSION-NUMBER     PIC 9(2) VALUE 1.
01 WS-MAX-TRANSACTIONS   PIC 9(6) VALUE 10000.
01 WS-INTEREST-RATE      PIC 99V99 VALUE 2.50.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "========================================".
    DISPLAY "       BANKING SYSTEM CONFIGURATION".
    DISPLAY "========================================".
    DISPLAY "BANK NAME:          " WS-BANK-NAME.
    DISPLAY "EXECUTION DATE:     " WS-EXECUTION-DATE.
    DISPLAY "VERSION NUMBER:     " WS-VERSION-NUMBER.
    DISPLAY "MAX TRANSACTIONS:   " WS-MAX-TRANSACTIONS.
    DISPLAY "INTEREST RATE:      " WS-INTEREST-RATE "%".
    DISPLAY "========================================".
    STOP RUN.
